// **Eats twice as often as anybody else.**
//
// The pure cost trait, and the pack needs one or every draw is a gift.
// A canteen's output is the tightest chain in the opening — meals come
// from produce, produce comes from a farm that needs two of three crew
// standing in it — so one person eating at twice the rate is a real
// claim on it, and the tower feels it as the larder emptying rather
// than as a number.
//
// Deliberately *not* paired with a compensating bonus. Somebody can
// just be hungry; a crew where every quirk nets to zero is a crew of
// interchangeable people wearing labels.
TraitDef(
    id: "trait.big_appetite",
    name: "Big appetite",
    blurb: "hungry again before the plates are cleared",
    hunger_pct: 50,
)
